            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>The long break gets a face of its own.</em></p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul><li>The five minute break offers three fixed recoveries: breathing, bilateral, screen-free</li><li>Breathing lets you pick the rhythm there — your setting stays the default</li></ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>The eye movement left the long break: five minutes of tracking a dot is not recovery</li><li>The launch-at-login notice now says what is true instead of blaming a development build</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Found updates stayed hidden behind other windows — FocusTimer now comes forward</li></ul>
]]></description>
